{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>They eat the sin of My people</b> — the sons of the priest. <b>And they bear the iniquity of My people</b> — as it says nearby, <b>to atone for iniquity</b>, in the manner of <b>and to him he bears the soul</b>, and this is a great iniquity. Therefore evil will come upon the priest and upon the people, and the priest will have no superiority over Israel."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:04.678327406Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}